      value: I
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: namesEng.Array.data[7]
      value: The Spider Queen
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsRu.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsEng.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsRu.Array.data[0]
      value: "\u0422\u044B... \u041F\u043E\u0431\u0435\u0434\u0438\u043B \u043C\u0435\u043D\u044F...
        \u0422\u044B \u0437\u0430\u0433\u0443\u0431\u0438\u043B \u0432\u0441\u0435
        \u043C\u043E\u0438 \u043C\u0435\u0447\u0442\u044B, \u043C\u0435\u0447\u0442\u044B
        \u043C\u043E\u0438\u0445 \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043A\u043E\u0432..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsRu.Array.data[1]
      value: "\u041C\u044B \u0434\u043E\u043B\u0436\u043D\u044B \u0431\u044B\u043B\u0438
        \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044C \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0438\u043D\u043E\u0439
        \u043F\u0438\u0449\u0435\u0432\u043E\u0439 \u0446\u0435\u043F\u0438, \u0432\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0438\u043D\u043E\u0439
        \u044D\u0442\u043E\u0433\u043E \u043C\u0438\u0440\u0430! \u041C\u044B, \u043F\u0430\u0443\u043A\u0438,\r
        \u0441\u0438\u043B\u044C\u043D\u0435\u0439\u0448\u0438\u0435!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsRu.Array.data[2]
      value: "\u0425\u043E\u0442\u044F, \u043D\u0435\u0442, \u0440\u0430\u0437 \u0442\u044B
        \u043F\u043E\u0431\u0435\u0434\u0438\u043B \u043D\u0430\u0441, \u0442\u043E
        \u043C\u044B \u0441\u043B\u0430\u0431\u044B... \u041A\u0430\u043A \u044F
        \u043C\u043E\u0433\u043B\u0430 \u0431\u044B\u0442\u044C \u0441\u0442\u043E\u043B\u044C
        \u0431\u0435\u0441\u043F\u0435\u0447\u043D\u043E\u0439... \u042F \u0434\u0443\u043C\u0430\u043B\u0430
        \u0441\u0438\u043B\u044C\u043D\u0435\u0435 \u043D\u0430\u0441 \u0443\u0436\u0435
        \u043D\u0438\u043A\u043E\u043C\u0443 \u043D\u0435 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u0442\u044C,
        \u043D\u043E \u0442\u044B..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsRu.Array.data[3]
      value: "\u042F - \u0442\u0432\u043E\u0440\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435 \u0447\u0435\u043B\u043E\u0432\u0435\u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430.
        \u0422\u0435\u0431\u044F \u043F\u043E\u0431\u0435\u0434\u0438\u043B \u043D\u0435
        \u044F, \u0430 \u043B\u044E\u0434\u0438."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsRu.Array.data[4]
      value: "\u041B\u044E\u0434\u0438!? \u041C\u043E\u0438 \u043F\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043A\u0438
        \u0443\u0431\u0438\u043B\u0438 \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0445 \u043B\u044E\u0434\u0435\u0439
        \u043D\u0430 \u044D\u0442\u043E\u043C \u043A\u043E\u043D\u0442\u0438\u043D\u0435\u043D\u0442\u0435!
        \u041E\u043D\u0438 \u0431\u044B\u043B\u0438 \u043A\u0430\u043A \u043C\u0443\u0445\u0438,
        \u043F\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0438\u0442\u044B! \u041E\u043D\u0438 \u0431\u044B\u043B\u0438
        \u0432\u0435\u0437\u0434\u0435, \u043D\u043E \u043C\u044B \u0432\u0441\u0435
        \u0436\u0435 \u043E\u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043B\u0438 \u043C\u0430\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0438\u043A
        \u043E\u0442 \u044D\u0442\u0438\u0445 \u0431\u043B\u043E\u0445!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsRu.Array.data[5]
      value: "\u041E\u043D\u0438 \u0431\u044B\u043B\u0438 \u043E\u0447\u0435\u043D\u044C
        \u0441\u043B\u0430\u0431\u044B... \u041A\u0430\u043A \u0436\u0435 \u043E\u043D\u0438
        \u0441\u043E\u0437\u0434\u0430\u043B\u0438 \u0442\u0435\u0431\u044F? \u041F\u043B\u043E\u0434
        \u0443\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0438? \u041F\u0440\u043E\u0441\u0442\u043E\u0435
        \u0432\u0435\u0437\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435? \u041D\u0435 \u043C\u043E\u0436\u0435\u0442
        \u0431\u044B\u0442\u044C..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsRu.Array.data[6]
      value: "\u042F \u0438 \u0441\u0430\u043C \u043D\u0435 \u0437\u043D\u0430\u044E
        \u043F\u043E\u0434\u0440\u043E\u0431\u043D\u043E\u0441\u0442\u0435\u0439.
        \u042F \u043B\u0438\u0448\u044C \u0437\u043D\u0430\u044E, \u043A\u0442\u043E
        \u043C\u0435\u043D\u044F \u0441\u043E\u0437\u0434\u0430\u043B."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsRu.Array.data[7]
      value: "\u042F\u0441\u043D\u043E... \u0412 \u043B\u044E\u0431\u043E\u043C \u0441\u043B\u0443\u0447\u0430\u0435
        \u044F \u0443\u0436\u0435 \u043C\u0435\u0440\u0442\u0432\u0435\u0446... \u0422\u044B
        \u0445\u0440\u0430\u0431\u0440\u043E \u0441\u0440\u0430\u0436\u0430\u043B\u0441\u044F,
        \u0434\u043B\u044F \u0442\u0430\u043A\u043E\u0433\u043E \u043C\u0435\u043B\u043A\u043E\u0433\u043E
        \u0441\u0443\u0449\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0430..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsEng.Array.data[0]
      value: You... Defeated me... You ruined all my dreams, the dreams of my ancestors...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsEng.Array.data[1]
      value: We were supposed to be the top of the food chain, the top of this world!
        We spiders are the strongest!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsEng.Array.data[2]
      value: Although, no, since you defeated us, then we are weak... How could I
        be so careless... I thought no one could become stronger than us, but you...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsEng.Array.data[3]
      value: I am the creation of mankind. You were defeated not by me, but by people.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsEng.Array.data[4]
      value: People!? My ancestors killed all the people on this continent! They
        were like flies, parasites! They were everywhere, but we still cleared the
        mainland of these fleas!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsEng.Array.data[5]
      value: They were very weak... How did they create you? The fruit of luck? Simple
        luck? Not happening...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsEng.Array.data[6]
      value: I don't know the details myself. I only know who created me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1685464763887809082, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogTextsEng.Array.data[7]
      value: Clear... Anyway, I'm already a dead man... You fought bravely, for such
        a small creature...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2618986485598410304, guid: 8d75d8ec05784ea488d2391948827b96, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
